---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "@/components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy information for visitors to RWA Wire.">
  <div class="wire-container max-w-content py-10 sm:py-14">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: "Privacy", href: "/privacy/" }]} />
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-muted">Last updated: September 27, 2026</p>
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-wire mt-8 max-w-none">
      <p>RWA Wire is currently a static website hosted through GitHub Pages. We do not currently operate user accounts, a newsletter database or an on-site payment system.</p>
      <p>When you visit the site, the hosting provider and services reached through external links may process technical information such as IP addresses, browser information and request logs according to their own policies.</p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>RWA Wire links to third-party services, including Telegram and affiliate partners. When you follow an external link, the destination service's privacy practices apply.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>This notice will be updated if RWA Wire adds analytics, newsletters, advertising, accounts or other services that change how data is processed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
